[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4644049299","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120069#issuecomment-4644049299","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120069","id":4644049299,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFM6Rkw","user":{"login":"TheOathMan","id":57967535,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3OTY3NTM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57967535?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan","html_url":"https://github.com/TheOathMan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-07T20:45:19Z","updated_at":"2026-06-07T20:49:40Z","body":"> Storing records for directories is not required, but it is a normal behavior, so this is not a bug and no reason for this change.\r\n> \r\n> Seems like Windows doesn't store directories, but most Unix tools do (probably because directories can have specific permissions set).\r\n\r\nIt shouldn't be the default behavior, or at the very least, there should be an option to disable it. Leaving it as is exposes two major failure areas: first, Windows users cannot unzip folders compressed by Godot, and second, it is impossible to repack a file to its original state.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4644049299/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4644084001","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120069#issuecomment-4644084001","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120069","id":4644084001,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFM8ZIQ","user":{"login":"TheOathMan","id":57967535,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3OTY3NTM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57967535?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan","html_url":"https://github.com/TheOathMan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-07T20:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-06-07T20:59:35Z","body":"repack a file to its original state is essential not only to my plugin but I imagine to so many Godot plugins out there, because they either rely on a user unzipping a file on windows or for my use case, repacking a file to its original state/format.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4644084001/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4644085305","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120069#issuecomment-4644085305","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120069","id":4644085305,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFM8eOQ","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-07T21:00:09Z","updated_at":"2026-06-07T21:00:09Z","body":"> Windows users cannot unzip folders compressed by Godot, and second, it is impossible to repack a file to its original state.\n\nWhat specific tool can't unzip it? Window should be be able to handle Unix created ZIP without issues.\n\nIf there's an issue with some tool it might be caused by names of stored directories (Unix zip seems to add / to the end of directory name, and Godot doesn't).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4644085305/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4644096915","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120069#issuecomment-4644096915","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120069","id":4644096915,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFM9Lkw","user":{"login":"TheOathMan","id":57967535,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3OTY3NTM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57967535?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan","html_url":"https://github.com/TheOathMan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-07T21:04:45Z","updated_at":"2026-06-07T21:04:45Z","body":"\r\n> What specific tool can't unzip it? Window should be be able to handle Unix created ZIP without issues.\r\n\r\nright click -> Extract all...\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4644096915/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4644103136","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120069#issuecomment-4644103136","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120069","id":4644103136,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFM9j4A","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-07T21:07:25Z","updated_at":"2026-06-07T21:07:25Z","body":"I'll check it tomorrow.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4644103136/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4645606135","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120069#issuecomment-4645606135","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120069","id":4645606135,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFOZS9w","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-08T05:00:56Z","updated_at":"2026-06-08T05:00:56Z","body":"> If there's an issue with some tool it might be caused by names of stored directories (Unix zip seems to add / to the end of directory name, and Godot doesn't).\r\n\r\nI can reproduce the issue on Windows, and it is fixed by adding `/` to the path.\r\n\r\n```diff\r\ndiff --git a/modules/zip/zip_packer.cpp b/modules/zip/zip_packer.cpp\r\nindex 8bc13ba7c9..35da37782d 100644\r\n--- a/modules/zip/zip_packer.cpp\r\n+++ b/modules/zip/zip_packer.cpp\r\n@@ -70,7 +70,7 @@ int ZIPPacker::get_compression_level() const {\r\n Error ZIPPacker::start_file(const String &p_path, BitField<FileAccess::UnixPermissionFlags> p_permissions, uint64_t p_modified_time) {\r\n \tERR_FAIL_COND_V_MSG(fa.is_null(), FAILED, \"ZIPPacker must be opened before use.\");\r\n \r\n-\tif (!p_path.get_base_dir().is_empty() && !directories.has(p_path.get_base_dir())) {\r\n+\tif (!p_path.get_base_dir().is_empty() && !directories.has(p_path.get_base_dir() + \"/\")) {\r\n \t\tadd_directory(p_path.get_base_dir(), 0755, p_modified_time);\r\n \t}\r\n \r\n@@ -136,8 +136,10 @@ Error ZIPPacker::close_file() {\r\n }\r\n \r\n Error ZIPPacker::add_directory(const String &p_path, BitField<FileAccess::UnixPermissionFlags> p_permissions, uint64_t p_modified_time) {\r\n+\tString path = p_path.ends_with(\"/\") ? p_path : p_path + \"/\";\r\n+\r\n \tERR_FAIL_COND_V_MSG(fa.is_null(), FAILED, \"ZIPPacker must be opened before use.\");\r\n-\tERR_FAIL_COND_V_MSG(directories.has(p_path), ERR_CANT_CREATE, vformat(\"Directory '%s' already exists.\", p_path));\r\n+\tERR_FAIL_COND_V_MSG(directories.has(path), ERR_CANT_CREATE, vformat(\"Directory '%s' already exists.\", path));\r\n \r\n \tuint64_t time = p_modified_time;\r\n \tif (time == 0) {\r\n@@ -168,7 +170,7 @@ Error ZIPPacker::add_directory(const String &p_path, BitField<FileAccess::UnixPe\r\n \tzipfi.internal_fa = 0;\r\n \r\n \tint err = zipOpenNewFileInZip4(zf,\r\n-\t\t\tp_path.utf8().get_data(),\r\n+\t\t\tpath.utf8().get_data(),\r\n \t\t\t&zipfi,\r\n \t\t\tnullptr,\r\n \t\t\t0,\r\n@@ -190,7 +192,7 @@ Error ZIPPacker::add_directory(const String &p_path, BitField<FileAccess::UnixPe\r\n \t\treturn FAILED;\r\n \t}\r\n \r\n-\tdirectories.insert(p_path);\r\n+\tdirectories.insert(path);\r\n \treturn OK;\r\n }\r\n ```","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4645606135/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4645704565","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120069#issuecomment-4645704565","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120069","id":4645704565,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFOfTdQ","user":{"login":"TheOathMan","id":57967535,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3OTY3NTM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57967535?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan","html_url":"https://github.com/TheOathMan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-08T05:24:49Z","updated_at":"2026-06-08T05:24:49Z","body":"> ```diff\r\n> String path = p_path.ends_with(\"/\") ? p_path : p_path + \"/\";\r\n> ```\r\n\r\ntried your fixed, also works. Thanks","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4645704565/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4645974648","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120069#issuecomment-4645974648","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120069","id":4645974648,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFOvyeA","user":{"login":"TheOathMan","id":57967535,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3OTY3NTM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57967535?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan","html_url":"https://github.com/TheOathMan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/orgs","repos_u